    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "원고는 지금 교열 중이다",
      "text": "The <b>manuscript</b> is under revision now."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "세월의 흐름과 함께 원고도 누르께해졌다",
      "text": "The <b>manuscript</b> was yellowed with age."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그 저작은 벌써 탈고되었다",
      "text": "The work is already complete in <b>manuscript</b>."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그는 자신의 원고를 인쇄에 박였다",
      "text": "He got his <b>manuscript</b> printed. or He had them print his <b>manuscript</b>."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "원고를 챙겨서 보내 드리지요",
      "text": "I will get the <b>manuscript</b> in order and send it to you."
